---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/common/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/common/Footer.astro';
import FloatingWhatsApp from '../components/common/FloatingWhatsApp.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';

const lastUpdated = 'September 3, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${siteConfig.name}`}
  description={`Privacy Policy for ${siteConfig.name}. Learn how Apex Content Lab handles information collected through its website and services.`}
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="flex-grow">
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/50 via-white to-white py-12 lg:py-16 border-b border-gray-100">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-3">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-500">
          Last Updated: {lastUpdated}
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 lg:py-16 bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Apex Content Lab respects your privacy and is committed to handling personal information responsibly. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected, used, and protected when you interact with our website, resources, and services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">2. Information We May Collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Depending on how you interact with Apex Content Lab, we may collect information such as your name, email address, business information, contact details, messages, project requirements, and other information you voluntarily provide.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">3. How We Use Information</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Information may be used to respond to inquiries, provide requested resources, communicate about services, evaluate project requirements, deliver services, improve our website and customer experience, and maintain appropriate business records.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Apex Content Lab may use third-party providers for services such as website hosting, analytics, email delivery, scheduling, payments, automation, and other operational functions. Those providers may process information according to their own privacy policies and terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">5. Data Security</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We take reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect information from unauthorized access, misuse, alteration, or disclosure. However, no internet-based system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">6. Data Retention</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Information may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, to provide services, maintain business records, resolve disputes, or satisfy applicable legal and operational requirements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">7. Your Choices</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            You may contact Apex Content Lab regarding information you have provided, including questions about communications or requests concerning your personal information, subject to applicable requirements and limitations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">8. Policy Updates</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            This Privacy Policy may be updated when our practices, services, or legal requirements change. The updated version will be published on this page with a revised date.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">9. Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            For privacy-related questions, contact {siteConfig.contact.primaryEmail}.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
  <FloatingWhatsApp />
</BaseLayout>
